# mm.mcu test target

Exercises every entry point of the portable hardware interface against a
stand-in platform. platform.cpp is that platform: an ordinary translation unit
defining the extern "C" ABI, which is the same mechanism a board's sources or a
vendor adapter uses. It is listed first because the interface it satisfies is
declared, not imported.
